{"version":1,"content":"<p>37歲的周志文、周志康由參加無綫唱歌比賽《超級巨聲》入行至今，在「細孖」志康成功打造的「企鵝人」助攻下，將於明天(28日)假麥花臣舉行《兄弟‧無雙演唱會》，終圓孿生兄弟首度合體的開騷夢。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;日前兩兄弟</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T08:04:00.182886+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":109,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T06:54:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:19.440353+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T07:57:19.440353+00:00","content_hash":"b027e269fcc603028874d4c7bff6dfe940613f8d4cb7ceef844caa5bad22cfd0","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}